=== .DATA BÖLÜMÜ (Veri Hafızası) ===
Direktif / Etiket      | 32-Bit Saf Veri (Binary)            | Hex Veri
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.word 10               | 00000000000000000000000000001010    | 0x0000000A
.word 20               | 00000000000000000000000000010100    | 0x00000014
.word 0                | 00000000000000000000000000000000    | 0x00000000


=== .TEXT BÖLÜMÜ (Çalıştırılabilir Kod) ===
Komut (Instruction)    | 32-Bit Makine Kodu                  | Hex Kod
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
addi x1, x0, 5         | 00000000010100000000000010010011    | 0x00500093
addi x2, x0, 50        | 00000011001000000000000100010011    | 0x03200113
add  x3, x1, x2        | 00000000001000001000000110110011    | 0x002081B3
beq  x1, x2, END       | 00000000001000001000011001100011    | 0x00208663
sub  x4, x2, x1        | 01000000000100010000001000110011    | 0x40110233
sw   x3, 0(x5)         | 00000000001100101010000000100011    | 0x0032A023


=== SEMBOL TABLOSU ===
Etiket (Label)  | Adres (Dec)  | Adres (Hex)
---------------------------------------------
sayi_on         | 0            | 0x0000
sayi_yirmi      | 4            | 0x0004
sonuc           | 8            | 0x0008
START           | 12           | 0x000C
END             | 36           | 0x0024
